 as a way of remembering her dreams and emotions. She has the appearance of a ball jointed doll (BJD), with visible doll joints. \nShe often appears calm and even emotionless, but is actually a very kind and caring person. \nHer main design motifs are butterflies and stars.\n\nI would love for you to design an outfit for her if possible. I really love your design sense, so feel free to design as you'd like!\nIf possible, an illustration similar to this style would be great;\nhttps://x.com/1010yuge1010/status/1757587021399576719\nhttps://x.com/1010yuge1010/status/1747184708751093801\n\nFeel free to change her hairstyle if you'd like to too!\n\nThis illustration would be for personal use only.\n\nThank you for your consideration!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ouq-vHpVFPdu-_pHTNMopHc-qOBjSmYe?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@1010yuge1010/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2076892, "client_id": 496888, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1b22cd8/uploads/origins/6def477c-db63-4494-9b26-204aaee54874?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2d2794a93205abd09e3342433de521d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e1b22cd8/uploads/origins/6def477c-db63-4494-9b26-204aaee54874?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2d2794a93205abd09e3342433de521d, https://si.imgix.net/e1b22cd8/uploads/origins/6def477c-db63-4494-9b26-204aaee54874?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d60ca875c1bce713d2b418f89c2a8e8a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e1b22cd8/uploads/origins/6def477c-db63-4494-9b26-204aaee54874?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f39b0d6cc892fa09db49392c6a898a06 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail